ss or None. Good.\n\nNow, there's a concern: `get_currency_code` import — let me verify it exists in `core.utils.catalog_helpers`. The `views_detail.py` imports it from there. So yes.\n\nAlso `get_display_price` from `price.services.currency_converter`. Yes.\n\n### Step 2: Register URLs in `sku/urls.py`\n\nAdd imports and paths.\n\n### Step 3: Frontend `GlobalSearch.vue`\n\nLet me write a component with:\n- A labeled section \"Глобальный поиск модели по артикулу\".\n- Input field.\n- Debounce (300ms).\n- Dropdown of results (max 10) showing code + name + equipment type.\n- On select: navigate to `/sku/:skuId`.\n\nLet me write it carefully with styles to fit the header (which is dark blue bg with white text).\n\nActually, the header is dark blue (`--site-header-bg: var(--cat-primary, #2563eb)`). The search box needs to be readable. I'll style it appropriately (white input, dropdown below).\n\nLet me write the component.\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <div class=\"global-search\" ref=\"root\">\n    <div class=\"gs-label\">Глобальный поиск модели по артикулу</div>\n    <div class=\"gs-box\">\n      <input\n        v-model=\"query\"\n        class=\"gs-input\"\n        type=\"text\"\n        placeholder=\"Введите артикул…\"\n        @input=\"onInput\"\n        @focus=\"onFocus\"\n        @keydown.down.prevent=\"move(1)\"\n        @keydown.up.prevent=\"move(-1)\"\n        @keydown.enter.prevent=\"selectCurrent\"\n        @keydown.esc=\"close\"\n      />\n      <div v-if=\"open && results.length\" class=\"gs-dropdown\">\n        <button\n          v-for=\"(r, i) in results\"\n          :key=\"r.sku_id\"\n          class=\"gs-item\"\n          :class=\"{ 'gs-item--active': i === activeIndex }\"\n          @mousedown.prevent=\"select(r)\"\n          @mouseenter=\"activeIndex = i\"\n        >\n          <span class=\"gs-code\">{{ r.code }}</span>\n          <span class=\"gs-name\">{{ r.name }}</span>\n          <span class=\"gs-type\">{{ r.equipment_type_name }}</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div v-else-if=\"open && query && !loading\" class=\"gs-dropdown gs-empty\">Ничего не найдено</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\nScript:\n```js\nimport { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from 'vue'\nimport { useRouter } from 'vue-router'\nimport api from '@/shared/api'\n\nconst router = useRouter()\nconst root = ref(null)\nconst query = ref('')\nconst results = ref([])\nconst open = ref(false)\nconst loading = ref(false)\nconst activeIndex = ref(-1)\nlet debounceTimer = null\n\nfunction onInput() {\n  activeIndex.value = -1\n  clearTimeout(debounceTimer)\n  const q = query.value.trim()\n  if (!q) { results.value = []; open.value = false; return }\n  debounceTimer = setTimeout(() => search(q), 300)\n}\n\nasync function search(q) {\n  loading.value = true\n  try {\n    const res = await api.get('/admin/sku/search/', { params: { q } })\n    results.value = res.data?.results || []\n    open.value = true\n  } catch (e) {\n    results.value = []\n    open.value = false\n  } finally {\n    loading.value = false\n  }\n}\n\nfunction onFocus() {\n  if (query.value.trim() && results.value.length) open.value = true\n}\n\nfunction select(r) {\n  if (!r || r.sku_id == null) return\n  close()\n  router.push(`/sku/${r.sku_id}`)\n}\n\nfunction move(dir) {\n  if (!results.value.length) return\n  activeIndex.value = (activeIndex.value + dir + results.value.length) % results.value.length\n}\n\nfunction selectCurrent() {\n  if (activeIndex.value >= 0 && results.value[activeIndex.value]) select(results.value[activeIndex.value])\n}\n\nfunction close() { open.value = false }\n\nfunction onClickOutside(e) {\n  if (root.value && !root.value.contains(e.target)) close()\n}\n\nonMounted(() => document.addEventListener('click', onClickOutside))\nonUnmounted(() => { document.removeEventListener('click', onClickOutside); clearTimeout(debounceTimer) })\n```\n\nStyles: fit header. The header has height 56px. The search should be compact.\n\nActually, the \"Гло